  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00910",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“于是，一个亲戚特地出去打听。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "So one of his relatives went out of their way to ask around.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00910",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "说是实际上，既没有和女人同居，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "They said that, in fact, he had not been living with a woman,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00910",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "也没有吃喝嫖赌欠债的样子，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "nor did he seem to have run up debts from drinking, carousing, womanizing, or gambling,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00910",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "没有一点具体的动机。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and there was not the slightest concrete motive.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00910",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "那么究竟是怎么回事呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Then what on earth had happened?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00910",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "……听听那青年人说的，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "...But when they listened to what the young man had to say,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00910",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "更让人摸不着头脑……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "it only made things even harder to understand...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00910",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "他就说了句‘再也忍受不下去了’，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He only said, 'I cannot stand it anymore,'",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00910",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "其他的，连他自己也说不清楚。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and as for the rest, even he himself could not explain it clearly.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
